window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Secrets unravel and loyalties are tested in the gripping finale of the Dark Awakening trilogy. As Ell-rom and Jasmine face their most daunting challenges yet, a young prodigy's awakening abilities threaten to upset the immortal community's delicate balance.</p> <p>As echoes of the past resurface, who will rise, who will fall, and who will ultimately answer destiny's call?</p>"; 
